# Optional, for desktop dev only. The normal way to set a key is Settings → API
# key in the app, which stores it in that browser's localStorage and keeps it out
# of the build. Only needed for the two network features: word lookup and example
# sentences. Everything else — conjugation, stacking, the quiz, audio — runs
# entirely offline and needs no key.
#
# Vite exposes VITE_* variables to the browser bundle, which means the key is
# visible to anyone with devtools. Acceptable for a local tool on your own
# machine. Put a server proxy in front of it before deploying anywhere.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
